text_font=497
text=You are asked for your full name and date of birth by a player that you have been chatting with for a short while. Should you give them these details?
color=2368304

[com_336570]
type=text
x=45
y=198
width=363
height=32
parent_id=0
text_font=497
text=No. The player could use my information to steal my identity. I don't want anyone pretending to be me.
color=1644848

[com_356083]
type=text
x=45
y=252
width=363
height=32
parent_id=0
text_font=497
text=Yes. There's no harm in telling someone my full name and my birthday. They're only being friendly.
color=1644848

